      "english_text": "\"Why won't Wukong help us?\" the horse asked Bajie. The pig sighed . \"He told us not to look for him if we needed help . Plus I kept telling Master to use the Tight Headband spell. I'll bet the monkey is really mad at me.\" \"That doesn't matter now,\" said the horse. \"You must get Wukong to come back.\" Bajie hesitated for a moment and then leaped onto a cloud. He soared through the sky and soon arrived at the Fruit and Flower Mountain. He found Wukong sitting beside the big waterfall Other monkeys and apes were nearby. They held swords and spears . They stared at Bajie silently \"Hello, Wukong ,\" said the pig. \"This is a lovely mountain Wukong scowled . \"What are you doing here, Bajie?\" The pig looked at the ground . \"The Tang Monk would like you to come back,\" he mumbled \"Well, that's too bad ,\" said Wukong, standing up. \"He told me to leave . I'll never help him again \"Please come back ,\" said Bajie. \"We all miss you. \"I don't miss you,\" said Wukong. \"You told Master to use the Tight Headband spell. I should take out my iron bar and clobber you!\" Bajie forced a laugh . \"I was just joking , Wukong. I knew you were really just protecting Master.\" \"It wasn't funny ,\" said Wukong. \"That spell really hurts The pig began to cry . \"Please come back. The Tang Monk is in danger—big danger . A monster turned him into a tiger. And Wujing was captured Wukong shrugged . \"Just tell the monster that you're friends with me, the Monkey King. He'll be scared and leave all of you alone \"Oh, I did tell him about you,\" Bajie lied. \"Really ?\" Wukong leaned closer . \"What did he say Bajie bit his lip. \"He laughed and said that you're a tiny little coward Wukong's eyes blazed with fury . \"He will regret saying that! Let's go , Bajie!\"",
      "chinese_text": "E36 : Journey to the West ( Tricked Again 悟空的 骗局)上 “为什么悟空不会帮我们?” 马问八戒。八戒叹了口气。“他告诉过我 们,如果需要帮助别去找他。而且我还老是撺掇师父念紧箍咒。我敢说那猴 子肯定对我气坏了。”“现在这都不重要了,” 马说道,“你必须把悟空 带回来。” 悟空 帮助 询问 叹息 需要 帮助 此外 事情 悟空 八戒犹豫了一下,然后跳上一朵云。他在天空中疾驰,很快就来到了花果 山。 他发现悟空正坐在大瀑布旁边。周围还有其他的猴子猴孙,它们手持刀剑和 长矛,静静地盯着八戒。 八戒低下头看着地面。“唐僧希望你回去。” 他咕哝道。 犹豫 跳跃 翱翔 到达 找到 瀑布 猴子 剑 矛 默默地 悟空 可爱的 山 皱眉,怒视 做 看,瞧 地面,土地 僧侣,和尚 嘀咕,含糊地说 坏的 告诉 离开 帮助 再次 “哦,那可太遗憾了,” 悟空说着站了起来,“他叫我走的。我再也不会 “我可不想你们。” 悟空说,“你叫师父念紧箍咒。我真该拿出金箍棒揍 八戒勉强挤出一丝笑容。“我只是开个玩笑,悟空。我知道你其实是在保护 “一点都不好笑,” 悟空说,“那咒语疼得要命!” 请 回来 想念 错过 强迫 笑 开玩笑 保护 有趣的 咒语 疼痛 猪 开始 哭 危险 怪物 捕获 八戒开始哭起来。“求你回去吧。唐僧有危险 —— 大麻烦了。一个妖怪把 悟空耸耸肩。“你就告诉那妖怪,你是我美猴王的朋友。他肯定会吓得不敢 “哦,我跟他提过你了。” 八戒撒了个谎。 八戒咬着嘴唇。“他嘲笑说你就是个胆小如鼠的小毛猴。” 悟空的眼睛里燃起怒火。“他会为这话后悔的!咱们走,八戒!” 耸肩 怪物 朋友 害怕的 独自 告诉 关于 真的吗 倾斜;靠 更近的 什么 说;讲 咬 笑 微小的懦夫 眼睛 燃烧,发光 愤怒 遗憾,后悔 说,讲 去"
